hub:{name:"Hub",accent:"#2f7d45",context:"Suite control centre",nav:["Apps","Models","Activity","About"],title:"Your research tools, in one place",lede:"Launch, install, and maintain the Artifice suite from one quiet control centre.",main:`<div class="cards"><article class="card" style="--card-accent:#017259"><header><h3>Artifice OCR</h3></header><p>Turn archival scans into reviewable, structured text.</p><small>0.3.0 · Ready</small><br><button class="btn primary">Open OCR</button></article><article class="card" style="--card-accent:#892254"><header><h3>Artifice Draft</h3></header><p>Review prose with transparent, structured suggestions.</p><small>0.3.0 · Ready</small><br><button class="btn primary">Open Draft</button></article><article class="card" style="--card-accent:#715993"><header><h3>Artifice Transcribe</h3></header><p>Produce and refine timestamped oral-history transcripts.</p><small>0.3.0 · Ready</small><br><button class="btn primary">Open Transcribe</button></article><article class="card" style="--card-accent:#066a9c"><header><h3>Artifice Graph</h3></header><p>Extract entities, relationships, and evidence from sources.</p><small>Update available</small><br><button class="btn">Update</button></article></div>`,inspect:`<h2>System readiness</h2><div class="field"><label>Local model engine</label><select><option>Ollama · Connected</option></select></div><p class="meta">4 tools installed<br>3 models ready<br>1 update available</p>`},
ocr:{name:"OCR",accent:"#017259",context:"LSE pamphlets · 24 pages",nav:["Queue","Review","History","Insights","Settings"],title:"Review recognised text",lede:"Compare each scan with its transcription, then continue the verified text into another research tool.",main:`<div class="workflow"><div class="source-list"><div class="source selected">Page 01<br><small>94% confidence</small></div><div class="source">Page 02<br><small>91% confidence</small></div><div class="source">Page 03<br><small>Needs review</small></div></div><article class="pane document-pane"><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn">Raw</button><button class="btn primary">Cleaned</button><button class="btn">Translated</button></div><h3>The conditions of labour</h3><p>It is necessary first to understand the conditions under which this account was written. The evidence preserved here is partial, yet its silences are themselves instructive.</p><div class="suggestion">Low confidence: “conditions” · inspect line image</div></article></div>`,inspect:`<h2>Page details</h2><p class="meta">Page 1 of 24<br>English · Printed text</p><div class="field"><label>Continue in…</label><select><option>Artifice Draft</option><option>Artifice Graph</option></select></div><button class="btn primary">Save and continue</button>`},
draft:{name:"Draft",accent:"#892254",context:"chapter-three.docx",nav:["Document","Review","Style guides","Settings"],title:"Review editorial suggestions",lede:"Accept, reject, or revise changes while keeping the argument and source voice visible.",main:`<article class="pane document-pane"><p class="eyebrow">Suggestion 4 of 18</p><h3>Clarity and register</h3><p>The archive does not merely preserve evidence; <mark>it also constructs the boundaries of what can be known</mark>.</p><div class="suggestion"><s>also makes limits for knowledge</s><br><b>constructs the boundaries of what can be known</b></div><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn primary">Accept</button><button class="btn">Reject</button><button class="btn">Edit</button></div></article>`,inspect:`<h2>Suggestion</h2><p class="meta">Clarity · Medium confidence</p><p>Replaces an imprecise phrase while preserving the claim’s meaning.</p><div class="field"><label>Style guide</label><select><option>Chicago 17</option></select></div><button class="btn">Accept all clarity edits</button>`},
transcribe:{name:"Transcribe",accent:"#715993",context:"Interview with A. Mensah · 48:12",nav:["Jobs","Transcripts","People & dictionary","Settings"],title:"Refine the transcript",lede:"Listen, correct the record, and identify speakers without losing the timing of the original recording.",main:`<article class="pane document-pane"><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn primary">▶ 12:42</button><span class="progress" style="flex:1"><i style="width:28%"></i></span></div><p><b>AM · 12:38</b><br>We met in the reading room each Thursday, although nobody called it a meeting then.</p><p><b>MC · 12:47</b><br>Who brought the documents?</p><p><b>AM · 12:51</b><br>Usually Miriam. She had access to the committee files.</p></article>`,inspect:`<h2>Speaker</h2><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input value="A. Mensah"></div><p class="meta">18 segments · 14m 22s</p><button class="btn primary">Save speaker</button>`},
